&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;142&quot; data-end=&quot;163&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;145&quot; data-end=&quot;163&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;165&quot; data-end=&quot;307&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a sharp, commercially-minded finance leader to own our Germany and AMEA Expansion Market&#39;s financial strategy and lay the foundations for European expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;309&quot; data-end=&quot;593&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll act as the central voice on performance, forecasting, and financial decision-making. From CAC and contribution margin to free cash flow and scenario planning, you’ll be responsible for turning financial insight into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;595&quot; data-end=&quot;877&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with cross-functional leaders across growth, operations, product, and care to shape the our Germany and AMEA Expansion Market&#39;s financial trajectory, while ensuring the business runs efficiently and invests wisely. This is a high-trust, high-impact role where the stakes, and the pace, are high.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;879&quot; data-end=&quot;1035&quot;&gt;While this role is DE and Expansion market focused today, it has clear runway to grow into a broader European leadership role as we expand across new markets and business lines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1042&quot; data-end=&quot;1079&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1045&quot; data-end=&quot;1079&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Responsible For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1083&quot; data-end=&quot;1266&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1083&quot; data-end=&quot;1113&quot;&gt;Own the Germany and AMEA Expansion Market financial model&lt;/strong&gt; — Build and manage end-to-end models for revenue, CAC, LTV, margin, and free cash flow. Your outputs will guide day-to-day decisions and long-term bets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1410&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1298&quot;&gt;Lead the planning process&lt;/strong&gt; — Drive monthly re-forecasting, annual planning, and scenario modelling in close collaboration with Group FP&amp;amp;A.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;Be the commercial partner to growth and ops&lt;/strong&gt; — Set CAC and payback targets, assess performance by cohort, and guide spend allocation to maximise ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1739&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1615&quot;&gt;Run commercial analysis that unlocks growth&lt;/strong&gt; — Lead deep dives into pricing, retention, margin, and expansion levers to identify opportunities and recommend trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1742&quot; data-end=&quot;1920&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1742&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;Make the numbers visible&lt;/strong&gt; — Build dashboards and trackers for key DE performance metrics (e.g. contribution margin, CAC, LTV, cash flow), keeping the business tightly aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1923&quot; data-end=&quot;2065&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1923&quot; data-end=&quot;1970&quot;&gt;Ensure clean, accurate financial operations&lt;/strong&gt; — Partner with Group Finance on reconciliations, cost allocation, and timely month-end closes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2068&quot; data-end=&quot;2202&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2068&quot; data-end=&quot;2087&quot;&gt;Build for scale&lt;/strong&gt; — Design financial systems and insights that don’t just serve the German markets, but become the blueprint for future markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2209&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2212&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2227&quot; data-end=&quot;2254&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2231&quot; data-end=&quot;2254&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2258&quot; data-end=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2258&quot; data-end=&quot;2291&quot;&gt;6+ years in strategic finance&lt;/strong&gt;, FP&amp;amp;A, consulting, or banking, with experience in high-growth or tech-enabled businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2384&quot; data-end=&quot;2521&quot;&gt;Proven experience owning &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2409&quot; data-end=&quot;2450&quot;&gt;P&amp;amp;L and end-to-end planning processes&lt;/strong&gt; — ideally in a business with both consumer and operational complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2524&quot; data-end=&quot;2633&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2546&quot; data-end=&quot;2587&quot;&gt;CAC, LTV, payback, cash flow dynamics&lt;/strong&gt;, and how these fuel long-term value creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2636&quot; data-end=&quot;2742&quot;&gt;Highly proficient in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2657&quot; data-end=&quot;2682&quot;&gt;Google Sheets / Excel&lt;/strong&gt; (bonus points for SQL, Looker, NetSuite, or similar tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2745&quot; data-end=&quot;2869&quot;&gt;Strong commercial instincts — you&#39;re as comfortable in the numbers as you are helping teams make smart, trade-off decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2871&quot; data-end=&quot;2901&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2875&quot; data-end=&quot;2901&quot;&gt;Behaviours &amp;amp; Attitudes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2905&quot; data-end=&quot;2980&quot;&gt;You &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2909&quot; data-end=&quot;2922&quot;&gt;move fast&lt;/strong&gt; and bias toward action, even without perfect information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2983&quot; data-end=&quot;3064&quot;&gt;You bring a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2995&quot; data-end=&quot;3019&quot;&gt;strong point of view&lt;/strong&gt;, but you’re open to challenge and new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3067&quot; data-end=&quot;3159&quot;&gt;You get energy from &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3087&quot; data-end=&quot;3114&quot;&gt;messy, complex problems&lt;/strong&gt; and know how to bring structure and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3162&quot; data-end=&quot;3252&quot;&gt;You &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3166&quot; data-end=&quot;3182&quot;&gt;own outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;, not just analysis — you want to see your insights drive performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3255&quot; data-end=&quot;3344&quot;&gt;You’re calm under pressure, confident with ambiguity, and committed to delivering impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pilot.com.au/&quot;&gt;Pilot,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.kinfertility.com.au/&quot;&gt;Kin&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://skin.software/&quot;&gt;Software&lt;/a&gt;) across men’s health and well-being, fertility, and skincare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next&lt;/strong&gt; - Our goal for the next three years is to support &lt;strong&gt;1 million patients globally&lt;/strong&gt; to live better for longer. We’re launching into new conditions, demographics, and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing&lt;/strong&gt; - We’re on the path to becoming the world’s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact&lt;/strong&gt; - You will deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth&lt;/strong&gt; - You will have high ownership, continuous feedback, and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team&lt;/strong&gt; - You will collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s ahead in the UK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Annual development budget plus 3 days of professional development leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work flexibly&lt;/strong&gt; – Hybrid setup with 3 days a week in our Old Street office, designed for focus and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Private health insurance through Vitality or opt for a monthly wellness allowance to spend on what matters most to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take time off&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days of holiday, enhanced parental leave and work from anywhere 3 weeks out of the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a connected team&lt;/strong&gt; – A vibrant office culture with regular socials, clubs, after-school sport, and seasonal events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks partners with clients to build impactful digital products which deliver extraordinary customer experiences. We do this by integrating design, strategy and technology. We’re looking for a seasoned product leader, with experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;identifying, launching and scaling&lt;/strong&gt; new products and product portfolio and with a background in &lt;strong&gt;Banking / Financial Services / Fintech and Consulting&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Customer Experience, Product and Design (CXPD) service line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a trusted advisor to our client’s leadership, you will partner with them to understand their context and needs, make recommendations, and provide advice and hands-on expertise on taking new products from concept to market to scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the innovation mindset and the overall product development lifecycle, utilising lean and hypothesis driven approaches to identify, conceptualise and pilot new products that deliver undeniable value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the market &amp;amp; competitive landscape, go to market strategy and business case or economic model for the opportunity with our clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the stakeholders to think about customer’s problems, business outcomes and take them on the change journey of moving to empowered product teams that create strategic growth for the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and lead teams to deliver client engagements in a way which is both effective for our client and operationally sound for Thoughtworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape CXPD service line value propositions, creating case studies, points of view and other content through insights on client needs and solutions, and also through defining repeatable practices which will help us to scale our efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get involved in pre-sales, creating proposals and pitches, shaping engagements for clients and helping to educate both clients and colleagues about the value of our services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the growth and scale of our evolving business through taking an active part in recruiting, community building, mentorship and driving continuous improvement in practices and techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in leading new ideas from concept to launch and scale with expertise in go-to-market strategy and developing new revenue streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in commercial and economic modelling, including monetisation strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in bringing an innovation mindset into an organisation at scale and creating sustained innovation investment across strategic horizons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth in conducting research and bringing market trends, customer and competitive insights to facilitate strategic ideation to identify opportunities for strategic growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth and expertise in developing value proposition, using lean approaches to test viability, feasibility and desirable to achieve problem-solution and product-market fit before scaling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated hypothesis and data driven problem-solving orientation with exceptional ability to create structured quantitative and qualitative analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate at company, portfolio and product level — defining and executing a strategy, shaping a vision and translating it into a roadmap with clear business and customer value-based measures of success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on becoming a value-driven, customer-centric product organisation and drive the change by introducing best practices in product management, value delivery and measurement and making innovation mainstream.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in the end-to-end product development lifecycle, agile and lean software development practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;professional-skills&quot;&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at operating and building relationships with C-suite executives and confident in driving conversations at the intersection of technology and business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills — active listening, persuading and empathising with others and excellent written and verbal communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to formulate and deliver insights around complex business problems in a thoughtful and persuasive manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consulting skills and can operate with ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias for action, and can break down complex problems into tangible steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy collaborating with multidisciplinary teams and can operate as an advisory but also as a hands on practitioner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about creating thought-leadership and representing our brand and value proposition in external events, and by writing articles or white papers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer amazing benefits from the day you start including private medical insurance, travel insurance, income protection, critical illness, life assurance, pension scheme, personal development budget, 25 days holiday and a ride2work scheme.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;DE&amp;amp;I&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We proudly, passionately and actively strive to make both Thoughtworks and our industry more representative of the communities we serve. We promote diversity in all its forms and reject discrimination and inequality. Our diversity and award winning culture inspires our thought leaders and serves to nurture and develop amazing ideas. We believe this makes us a world leading destination of choice for all technologists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Data Analyst (Supply)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prolific is not just another player in the AI space – we are the architects of the human data infrastructure that&#39;s reshaping the landscape of AI development. In a world where foundational AI technologies are increasingly commoditized, it&#39;s the quality and diversity of human-generated data that truly differentiates products and models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0&quot;&gt;As Prolific scales, maintaining a healthy and sustainable participant marketplace is critical to meeting the growing demand for high-quality human data. To champion this effort, you will own analytics across the entire participant lifecycle, spanning acquisition, onboarding, activation, engagement, quality, retention, and reactivation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1&quot;&gt;Working hands-on with SQL and Python, you will build the metrics, dashboards, and experimentation frameworks that help us understand behavior and improve the participant experience. By partnering closely with Product, Operations, Growth, and Data Science, you will identify opportunities, structure experiments, and translate complex marketplace data into clear decisions that ensure participant health, marketplace liquidity, and long-term supply sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll bring to the role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced SQL and strong Python proficiency (e.g. pandas, experimentation analysis, automation), with a track record of building scalable reporting frameworks in modern BI tools (Metabase, Looker, Tableau). Comfortable owning problems end-to-end — from raw data to executive-ready insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifecycle Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience analysing user acquisition, onboarding, activation, engagement, retention, churn, and behavioural cohorts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation &amp;amp; Statistics:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience designing and analysing A/B or operational experiments, with solid grounding in statistical concepts and causal thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to translate participant and marketplace challenges into measurable hypotheses, success metrics, and actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong ability to connect operational metrics to revenue, margin, and financial performance — understanding not just what is happening, but why it matters commercially.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable operating with high autonomy in a fast-moving environment, setting priorities, challenging assumptions, and driving initiatives from problem definition through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to partner across Product, Operations, Commercial, and Finance functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketplace Understanding:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong grasp of B2B and two-sided marketplace metrics and economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to translate complex analysis into concise, decision-ready insights that shape strategy and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Why Prolific is a great place to work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;ve built a unique platform that connects researchers and companies with a global pool of participants, enabling the collection of high-quality, ethically sourced human behavioral data and feedback. This data is the cornerstone of developing more accurate, nuanced, and aligned AI systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that the next leap in AI capabilities won&#39;t come solely from scaling existing models, but from integrating diverse human perspectives and behaviors into AI development. By providing this crucial human data infrastructure, Prolific is positioning itself at the forefront of the next wave of AI innovation – one that reflects the breath and the best of humanity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working for us will place you at the forefront of AI innovation, providing access to our unique human data platform and opportunities for groundbreaking research. Join us to enjoy a competitive salary, benefits, and remote working within our impactful, mission-driven culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Links to more information on Prolific&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/prolific/dbc97f2b3ff24f1bb6fa834a2c9c3283?v=4f874e88e46a4f54afd8bf62f1db19ed&amp;amp;p=9f2c1de05dfa43338d48c20362bfead1&amp;amp;pm=c&quot;&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
